# This repository holds Markdown only. These ignores exist so that operating-system and editor
# files, and anything shaped like a secret, never land in a public repository by accident.

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Secrets, as a safety net
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
